 e big bites. Moderation is for monks. When you do the common things in life in an uncommon way, you will command the attention of the world. Problems worthy of attack prove their worth by fighting back. Forgive your enemies, but never forget their names. Education is a progressive discovery of our own ignorance. Books are the shoes with which we tread the footsteps of great minds. I'd rather have a bottle in front of me than a ... brain operation. In any contest between power and patience, bet on patience. God is a comedian playing to an audience too afraid to laugh. The only time you run out of chances is when you stop taking them. A woman knows the face of the man she loves as a sailor knows the open sea. Three o'clock is always too late or too early for anything you want to do. A human being should be able to change a diaper, plan an invasion, butcher a hog, conn a shp, design a buil
