 gnosticism means. The secret of success is to know something nobody else knows. Only two t
 hings are infinite, the universe and human stupidity, and I'm not sure about the former. Reduce the complexity of life by eliminating the needless wants of life, and the labors of life reduce themselves. Memory is a child walking along a seashore. You never can tell what small pebble it will pick up and store away among its treasured things. Only two things are infinite, the universe and human stupidity, and I'm not sure about the former. He who has a 'why' to live, can bear with almost any 'how'. When solving problems, dig at the roots instead of just hacking at the leaves. A woman drove me to drink and I didn't even have the decency to thank her. I would like to believe when I die that I have given myself away like a tree that sows seed every spring and never counts the loss, because it is not loss, it is adding to future life.  It is the tree's way of being.  Strongly rooted perhaps,
  but spilling out its treasure on the wind. Books are the shoes with which we tread the fo
 otsteps of great minds. The difference between 'involvement' and 'commitment' is like an eggs-and-ham breakfast: the chicken was 'involved' - the pig was 'committed'. He who has a 'why' to live, can bear with almost any 'how'. Begin doing what you want to do now. We are not living in eternity. We have only this moment, sparkling like a star in our hand and melting like a snowflake. Some cause happiness wherever they go; others, whenever they go. It was the experience of mystery -- even if mixed with fear -- that engendered religion. God, please save me from your followers! If you ever reach total enlightenment while drinking beer, I bet it makes beer shoot out your nose. Treat everyone with politeness, even those who are rude to you. Not because they are nice, but because you are. An intelligent man is sometimes forced to be drunk to spend time with his fools. Everything in excess! To e
 njoy the flavor of life, take big bites. Moderation is for monks. Very little is needed to
  make a happy life. It is all within yourself, in your way of thinking. A friendship founded on business is better than a business founded on friendship. The opposite of a correct statement is a false statement. The opposite of a profound truth may well be another profound truth. The quality of the moment is more important than the number of our days. Very little is needed to make a happy life. It is all within yourself, in your way of thinking. Blessed is the man who, having nothing to say, abstains from giving us wordy evidence of the fact. It is much more comfortable to be mad and know it, than to be sane and have one's doubts. An intelligent man is sometimes forced to be drunk to spend time with his fools. Argue for your limitations, and sure enough they're yours. A kiss is a lovely trick designed by nature to stop speech when words become superfluous. When a friend is in trouble, d
 on't annoy him by asking if there is anything you can do. Think up something appropriate a
 nd do it. Don't stay in bed, unless you can make money in bed. If we had no winter, the spring would not be so pleasant; if we did not sometimes taste of adversity, prosperity would not be so welcome. Distance between two hearts is not an obstacle; rather a great reminder of just how strong true love can be. Where are we going, and why am I in this handbasket? Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. It is dangerous to be sincere unless you are also stupid. Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. A positive attitude will not solve all your problems, but it will annoy enough people to make it worth the effort. Argue for your limitations, and sure enough they're yours. Beer is proof that God loves us and wants us to be happy. A kiss is a lovely trick designed by nature to stop speech when words become superfluous. Education 
